The call answer score measures customers behavior to the delivered calls. The
score is a value between 0 and 100, where 100 indicates that all calls were
successfully answered.

=item call_state_percentage

Percentage of calls made in each state.

=item handle

Inbound phone number handle represented in the report.

=item silent_calls_percentage

Percentage of inbound calls with silence tags over total outbound calls. A
silent tag is indicative of a connectivity issue or muted audio.

